---
import {Image} from 'astro:assets';
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import '../styles/life-outcomes.css';
import {url,phone} from '../data/site';
import type {ImageMetadata} from 'astro';
const {page}=Astro.props;
const art=import.meta.glob<{default:ImageMetadata}>('../assets/*-social-20261001.png',{eager:true});
const poster=art['../assets/'+page.slug+'-social-20261001.png'].default;
const enquiry=url('/enroll-autism-speech-aba-therapies-india?service=help');
---
<PageLayout title={page.title} description={page.description} path={page.path} label={page.label} shareImage={poster} shareVersion={'life-v135-'+page.slug+'-20261001'} imageAlt={page.imageAlt} imageCaption="Illustrative Pinnacle campaign creative" documentOnly={true} includeService={false} citations={page.sources.map(s=>s.url)} faqs={page.faqs} updatedOn={page.updatedOn} breadcrumbParent={{name:'PinnacleAI',path:'/pinnacleai'}} enquiry={{url:enquiry,mobileLabel:'Start an enquiry'}}>
 <section class="wrap life-hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">{page.eyebrow}</p><h1>{page.headline}<em>{page.accent}</em></h1><p class="life-lead">{page.lead}</p><div class="life-actions"><a class="button primary" href={phone.href} data-cta="hero-call"><Icon name="telephone"/>{phone.display}</a><a class="button secondary" href={enquiry} data-cta="hero-assessment">Start a first conversation <Icon name="arrow"/></a></div><p class="life-small">Pinnacle / BHCL · Free 24/7 telephone guidance. The team confirms appointments, suitable professionals, services and fees.</p><a class="text-link" href="#life-first">How Pinnacle connects the work with life <Icon name="arrow"/></a></div><figure class="life-poster"><Image src={poster} widths={[480,800,1200]} sizes="(max-width:760px) 94vw, 48vw" width={1200} format="webp" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" alt={page.imageAlt}/><figcaption>A life-first direction: meaningful activities, relevant support and family participation.</figcaption></figure></section>
 <nav class="wrap life-jump" aria-label="On this page"><a href="#meaning">What it means</a><a href="#everyday-example">An everyday example</a><a href="#connected-pathway">The seven stages</a><a href="#evidence">Evidence you can inspect</a><a href="#questions">Your questions</a></nav>
 <section id="meaning" class="section wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Start with the life you want to open up</p><h2>{page.question}</h2><p class="life-answer">{page.answer}</p><div class="life-grid">{page.activities.map(item=><article><span class="life-icon"><Icon name={item.icon} size={30}/></span><h3>{item.title}</h3><p>{item.text}</p></article>)}</div></section>
 <section id="life-first" class="section life-tint"><div class="wrap life-purpose"><div><p class="eyebrow">The PinnacleAI® paradigm shift</p><h2>The child’s life gives every part of the work its purpose.</h2><p>You build a home for the life it makes possible. Its individual bricks serve that purpose. At Pinnacle, meaningful communication, routines, learning and participation give assessment, therapy, practice and review their direction.</p><p>Your family helps choose the priorities, understands the plan and brings real-life observations into review. Suitable professionals choose and adjust relevant support around your child.</p><a class="text-link" href={url('/verify/evidence/pinnacle-paradigm-shift.html')}>Read the documented life-first approach <Icon name="arrow"/></a></div><aside><Icon name="home" size={42}/><h3>Life → goals → people and methods → practice → review</h3><p>AbilityScore® and the readiness views help describe the starting picture and priorities. PinnacleAI® supports continuity; human judgement and your family’s experience keep the work relevant.</p><a href={url('/pinnacleai')}>Explore the whole PinnacleAI system →</a></aside></div></section>
 <section id="everyday-example" class="section wrap"><p class="eyebrow">One example · a useful way to think about the process</p><h2>{page.exampleTitle}</h2><blockquote>{page.exampleQuestion}</blockquote><ol class="life-example">{page.example.map((step,i)=><li><span>{i+1}</span><div><h3>{step.title}</h3><p>{step.text}</p></div></li>)}</ol><p class="life-small">This is an illustrative planning example. An appropriate professional and your family decide the actual goals and support.</p></section>
 <section id="connected-pathway" class="section life-tint"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Seven stages · one life-first direction</p><h2>A journey your family helps shape.</h2><ol class="life-stages">{page.stages.map((step,i)=><li><span class="life-stage-number">{i+1}</span><Icon name={step.icon} size={32}/><h3>{step.title}</h3><p>{step.text}</p><a href={url(step.path)}>Explore this part →</a></li>)}</ol><a class="text-link" href={url(page.related)}>{page.relatedLabel} <Icon name="arrow"/></a></div></section>
 <section class="section wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Family knowledge + suitable professional support</p><h2>{page.reviewTitle}</h2><div class="life-review">{page.review.map(item=><article><Icon name="check" size={28}/><h3>{item.title}</h3><p>{item.text}</p></article>)}</div><div class="life-therapies"><h3>The relevant contributions work together.</h3><p>Speech therapy can support communication. Occupational therapy can support daily activities and participation. Behavioural support and special education can contribute when the child-specific priorities indicate them.</p><nav aria-label="Relevant therapy explanations"><a href={url('/top-speech-therapy-center-india-proven-improvement-rate')}>Speech therapy</a><a href={url('/best-occupational-therapy-center-india-proven-improvement-rate')}>Occupational therapy</a><a href={url('/best-aba-therapy-center-india-proven-improvement-rate')}>ABA / behavioural support</a><a href={url('/best-special-education-center-call-9100181181')}>Special education</a><a href={url('/autism-therapy')}>Integrated autism support</a></nav></div></section>
 <section id="evidence" class="section life-proof"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Confidence with a source you can inspect</p><h2>Understand the purpose. Inspect the evidence.</h2><div class="life-source-grid">{page.sources.map(source=><article><Icon name="shield" size={27}/><h3>{source.title}</h3><p>{source.meaning}</p><a href={source.url}>Read the source →</a></article>)}</div><div class="life-downloads"><a href={url('/pinnacle-pages-data/'+page.slug+'-evidence.json')}>Source map · JSON</a><a href={url('/pinnacle-pages-data/'+page.slug+'-evidence.txt')}>Readable source map</a><a href={url('/verify/evidence/cite.html')}>Citation library</a></div></div></section>
 <section id="questions" class="section wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Questions families ask</p><h2>A clearer next step starts with a useful conversation.</h2><div class="faq">{page.faqs.map(faq=><details><summary>{faq.question}</summary><p>{faq.answer}</p></details>)}</div></section>
 <section class="section life-close"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Bring one moment that matters</p><h2>Tell us what you want to make more possible.</h2><p>The first conversation can help clarify a suitable assessment, professional and centre. You can ask what the visit includes, how your family participates and how the work will be reviewed before deciding.</p><div class="life-actions"><a class="button primary" href={phone.href} data-cta="final-call"><Icon name="telephone"/>Call {phone.display}</a><a class="button secondary" href={url('/centers')}>Find a Pinnacle centre <Icon name="arrow"/></a><a class="button secondary" href={enquiry} data-cta="final-assessment">Send an enquiry <Icon name="arrow"/></a></div><div class="life-downloads"><a href={'https://wa.me/?text='+encodeURIComponent(page.title+' '+url(page.path))}>Share on WhatsApp</a><a href={url('/pinnacle-pages-data/'+page.slug+'-machine.md')}>Copy-ready reading page</a></div></div></section>
</PageLayout>
